    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">The shapes and colors video uses vivid images of day to day objects and molds them into a plethora of different shapes. Childrens find the shapes and colors magical. The colors in the video stimulate their visual senses. The foot-tapping music keeps them elated. Introducing kids to different shapes in 2 and 3 dimension, bringing them together to create new objects, the animations are part of an enchanting experience for bright young minds</marc:subfield>
